msgstr "Log rewatches on Simkl (Pro or VIP)"

msgctxt "#32119"
msgid "Needs Simkl Pro or VIP (simkl.com/vip). Watching something again opens a new rewatch session on Simkl instead of keeping the first date, once at least 10% of it was really watched (replaying the ending is not a rewatch)."
msgstr "Needs Simkl Pro or VIP (simkl.com/vip). Watching something again opens a new rewatch session on Simkl instead of keeping the first date, once at least 10% of it was really watched (replaying the ending is not a rewatch)."

msgctxt "#32121"
msgid "Send watched marks made in the Kodi library to Simkl"
msgstr "Send watched marks made in the Kodi library to Simkl"

msgctxt "#32122"
msgid "Marking a movie, episode, season or show as watched in Kodi marks it on Simkl too. A single unmark removes an episode from the Simkl history; for a movie you are asked whether to remove it (its rating and note go too), move it to Plan to watch (they stay, the watch date goes) or keep it watched, and no answer keeps it. A movie with rewatch sessions on Simkl is never removed. Unmarking a whole season or show is not sent."
msgstr "Marking a movie, episode, season or show as watched in Kodi marks it on Simkl too. A single unmark removes an episode from the Simkl history; for a movie you are asked whether to remove it (its rating and note go too), move it to Plan to watch (they stay, the watch date goes) or keep it watched, and no answer keeps it. A movie with rewatch sessions on Simkl is never removed. Unmarking a whole season or show is not sent."

msgctxt "#32130"
msgid "Sync from Simkl"
msgstr "Sync from Simkl"

msgctxt "#32131"
msgid "Sync updates from Simkl"
msgstr "Sync updates from Simkl"

msgctxt "#32132"
msgid "Marks in the Kodi library what was watched on Simkl since the last sync. The first run fetches the whole history; a run after new items were added to the library marks them from the kept copy of it. What you unmarked in Kodi stays unwatched until Simkl sees a newer watch of it."
msgstr "Marks in the Kodi library what was watched on Simkl since the last sync. The first run fetches the whole history; a run after new items were added to the library marks them from the kept copy of it. What you unmarked in Kodi stays unwatched until Simkl sees a newer watch of it."

msgctxt "#32133"
msgid "Reset and sync everything again"
msgstr "Reset and sync everything again"

msgctxt "#32134"
msgid "Forgets what was synced and goes through the whole Simkl history again. Items already watched in Kodi keep their mark; their watch dates are refreshed from Simkl."
msgstr "Forgets what was synced and goes through the whole Simkl history again. Items already watched in Kodi keep their mark; their watch dates are refreshed from Simkl."

msgctxt "#32135"
msgid "Automatically sync updates from Simkl"
msgstr "Automatically sync updates from Simkl"

msgctxt "#32136"
msgid "Checks Simkl at the interval below and marks what is new, whenever Kodi is running but nothing is playing; a device nobody used since the last check (no key press, no playback, no change of the library) waits for the next use. With a library shared by several Kodi devices, switch this on for one device only."
msgstr "Checks Simkl at the interval below and marks what is new, whenever Kodi is running but nothing is playing; a device nobody used since the last check (no key press, no playback, no change of the library) waits for the next use. With a library shared by several Kodi devices, turn this on for one device only."

